[366.326122, "o", "./myapp --help 2>&1 | head -30\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[366.331185, "o", "myapp CLI\r\n\r\nUsage:\r\n  myapp [command]\r\n\r\nAvailable Commands:\r\n  migrate     Executes app DB migration scripts\r\n  serve       Starts the web server (default to 127.0.0.1:8090 if no domain is specified)\r\n  superuser   Manage superusers\r\n\r\nFlags:\r\n      --dev                    enable dev mode, aka. printing logs and sql statements to the console\r\n      --dir string             the PocketBase data directory (default \"pb_data\")\r\n      --encryptionEnv string   the env variable whose value of 32 characters will be used \r\n                               as encryption key for the app settings (default none)\r\n  -h, --help                   help for myapp\r\n      --queryTimeout int       the default SELECT queries timeout in seconds (default 30)\r\n  -v, --version                version for myapp\r\n\r\nUse \"myapp [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\r\n"]
[366.33209, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@bad99288-44a9-472f-bff2-d7501681cf33:/home/user/myproject# "]
[369.560917, "i", "./myapp migrate --help 2>&1\n"]
[369.56124, "o", "./myapp migrate --help 2>&1\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[369.566854, "o", "Supported arguments are:\r\n- up            - runs all available migrations\r\n- down [number] - reverts the last [number] applied migrations\r\n- create name   - creates new blank migration template file\r\n- collections   - creates new migration file with snapshot of the local collections configuration\r\n- history-sync  - ensures that the _migrations history table doesn't have references to deleted migration files\r\n\r\nUsage:\r\n  myapp migrate [flags]\r\n\r\nFlags:\r\n  -h, --help   help for migrate\r\n\r\nGlobal Flags:\r\n      --dev                    enable dev mode, aka. printing logs and sql statements to the console\r\n      --dir string             the PocketBase data directory (default \"pb_data\")\r\n      --encryptionEnv string   the env variable whose value of 32 characters will be used \r\n                               as encryption key for the app settings (default none)\r\n      --queryTimeout int       the default SELECT queries timeout in seconds (default 30)\r\n"]
[369.56775, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@bad99288-44a9-472f-bff2-d7501681cf33:/home/user/myproject# "]
